orrection_note":"Rewritten to the concise citizen-facing editorial standard.","created_at":"2026-08-30T16:27:04.173844Z","maturity":"post_opinion","revision_number":1}],"schema_version":"1.0","sections":[{"heading":"What this case is about","paragraphs":["Hansen faces charges for inducing noncitizens to stay in the U.S. illegally. He claims this law violates his free speech rights. The government says the law targets criminal conduct, not speech."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 4, lines 23-35","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/22-179_jgkn.pdf","page_label":"file page 4, lines 23-35"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 58, lines 17-13","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/22-179_jgkn.pdf","page_label":"file page 58, lines 17-13"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 66, lines 47-7","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/22-179_jgkn.pdf","page_label":"file page 66, lines 47-7"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 94, lines 39-11","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/22-179_jgkn.pdf","page_label":"file page 94, lines 39-11"}]},{"heading":"How the case got here","paragraphs":["The Supreme Court heard oral argument in this case on March 27, 2023."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 4, lines 11-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/22-179_jgkn.pdf","page_label":"file page 4, lines 11-21"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 76, lines 13-47","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/22-179_jgkn.pdf","page_label":"file page 76, lines 13-47"}]},{"heading":"What each side wants","paragraphs":["The government wants the Court to uphold Hansen's conviction.","Hansen wants the Court to reverse his conviction."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 4, lines 23-35","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/22-179_jgkn.pdf","page_label":"file page 4, lines 23-35"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 58, lines 17-13","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/22-179_jgkn.pdf","page_label":"file page 58, lines 17-13"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 66, lines 47-7","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/22-179_jgkn.pdf","page_label":"file page 66, lines 47-7"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 94, lines 39-11","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/22-179_jgkn.pdf","page_label":"file page 94, lines 39-11"}]},{"heading":"What each side says","paragraphs":["The government argues the statute targets criminal inducement, not protected speech.","Hansen argues the statute criminalizes protected speech and is unconstitutionally broad."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 4, lines 23-35","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/22-179_jgkn.pdf","page_label":"file page 4, lines 23-35"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 58, lines 17-13","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2022/22-179_jgkn.pdf","page_label":"file page 58, lines 17-13"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","l